{
  "scope": "batch003 newly delivered recordings only; full catalog remains incomplete",
  "lines": [
    {
      "source_id": "campaign_revision_2:aftermath_names_open_road",
      "speaker_id": "vale",
      "canonical_speaker": "vale",
      "text": "A road to the record. Not a claim that we carried everything.",
      "text_sha256": "6d7cc5ed77c5b77715fefd694e3b7b0fea0add55a899e072dd6ac542e2e373da",
      "cast_role": "vale",
      "direction": "",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "community"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "campaign_revision_2:aftermath_work_open_road",
      "speaker_id": "tor",
      "canonical_speaker": "tor",
      "text": "Dry tools underneath. Sleeping cloths on top. Nobody should have to unpack a whole cart to lie down.",
      "text_sha256": "5d25b3ae865efd6572030e4358a8466721f41fcac00aafae9884a55b48559609",
      "cast_role": "tor",
      "direction": "",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "community"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "campaign_revision_2:aftermath_work_open_road",
      "speaker_id": "rook",
      "canonical_speaker": "rook",
      "text": "I would prefer a lighter future. This one has cooking pots.",
      "text_sha256": "c7ad34cbab161e2055b96b4ef8e1314bed343b5e9e1d85c6ee68da3f83bb37f2",
      "cast_role": "rook",
      "direction": "",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "community"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "campaign_revision_2:aftermath_work_open_road",
      "speaker_id": "kael",
      "canonical_speaker": "kael",
      "text": "What stays?",
      "text_sha256": "1fd58204aa4e954a70804dc940a114e13f220b9240eafe99123e417703898eb6",
      "cast_role": "player",
      "direction": "",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "community"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "campaign_revision_2:aftermath_work_open_road",
      "speaker_id": "tor",
      "canonical_speaker": "tor",
      "text": "The walls. What we cannot carry. The people who freely chose another road know where we are going.",
      "text_sha256": "c7d8be20d51adf3f8ad2d3f6b156ae931cf1e96b0d8317a6d83e7575b66ea13f",
      "cast_role": "tor",
      "direction": "",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "community"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "campaign_revision_2:aftermath_work_open_road",
      "speaker_id": "rook",
      "canonical_speaker": "rook",
      "text": "The pots have arrived. Tomorrow somebody still has to cook.",
      "text_sha256": "c67cb6c73cc422c7d32f56ed89b7b3201d757ccd53fc652a3d2b0b6c33ef2740",
      "cast_role": "rook",
      "direction": "",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "community"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "campaign_revision_2:aftermath_road_open_road",
      "speaker_id": "nera",
      "canonical_speaker": "nera",
      "text": "The refuge has beds. It has no oath around it. We keep watch with people now.",
      "text_sha256": "721361c9a5a00122b67dc13ec821b709cdf2f64d9666a6711acecfe6801223c6",
      "cast_role": "nera",
      "direction": "",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "community"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "campaign_revision_2:aftermath_road_open_road",
      "speaker_id": "kael",
      "canonical_speaker": "kael",
      "text": "Can the road remain open behind us?",
      "text_sha256": "87313ae9635e5738b0b6242df13f6029ec5d53d2f2d3cfaef54fbe3a1bb9ff9a",
      "cast_role": "player",
      "direction": "",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "community"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "campaign_revision_2:aftermath_road_open_road",
      "speaker_id": "nera",
      "canonical_speaker": "nera",
      "text": "While we maintain it. Whoever comes later deserves to know both where it goes and what it costs.",
      "text_sha256": "84a6a7d5c4dcebb20d0ccb751af38001edce7b13bab9d750726566da1d9170f4",
      "cast_role": "nera",
      "direction": "",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "community"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "campaign_revision_2:aftermath_road_open_road",
      "speaker_id": "kael",
      "canonical_speaker": "kael",
      "text": "And the Hart?",
      "text_sha256": "8f8e925a539f0f9626ca8cc67d284f8c3c9c00571460e6921429d73f34eafe27",
      "cast_role": "player",
      "direction": "",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "community"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "campaign_revision_2:aftermath_road_open_road",
      "speaker_id": "nera",
      "canonical_speaker": "nera",
      "text": "We chose to leave its shelter and its full account. Keep the copies dry. Do not call them the whole of what we lost.",
      "text_sha256": "1820dbd1ccbf1cc4e6319d2d283d076d44a657e9c4d0e139f58b732fcc093875",
      "cast_role": "nera",
      "direction": "",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "community"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "community:routine:lantern_reach:saga_nessa:line",
      "speaker_id": "saga_nessa",
      "canonical_speaker": "nessa",
      "text": "Count the portions, not the mouths into debts. A person can eat here and still disagree with us afterward.",
      "text_sha256": "93dee8a66afc8b15c9532be2925bf34f14534fa0b38277883489cdf7b4948b9c",
      "cast_role": "nessa",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "community"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "community:routine:lantern_reach:widow_elna:line",
      "speaker_id": "widow_elna",
      "canonical_speaker": "elna",
      "text": "People keep bringing me empty bowls as if I can fill them with a speech. Give me a table that stays upright. I can begin there.",
      "text_sha256": "5bab5a51d0e9c607d7fe8cd080738033a5abcc28282e524e6fcc917f9bc16d80",
      "cast_role": "elna",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "community"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "community:routine:lantern_reach:farmer_toma:line",
      "speaker_id": "farmer_toma",
      "canonical_speaker": "toma",
      "text": "A common fire saves wood. Carrying shares home saves arguments. I can tell you what either costs; I cannot tell every household which cost to bear.",
      "text_sha256": "39efb7caecd57423caab38be17f841ab68c8ff387586f9103f0242708635ec35",
      "cast_role": "toma",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "community"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "community:routine:lantern_reach:blacksmith_tor:line",
      "speaker_id": "blacksmith_tor",
      "canonical_speaker": "tor",
      "text": "A beam can look straight and still have a rotten seat. Hold it while I check the bearing. We are building for the cart after ours, too.",
      "text_sha256": "ad47a47e1b7ddfabde306b0f3764d121756296104541f5397fda5d5e8723fa5b",
      "cast_role": "tor",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "community"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "community:routine:lantern_reach:rook:line",
      "speaker_id": "rook",
      "canonical_speaker": "rook",
      "text": "The water is slow here until the mill lets a pulse through. Read the wet marks on both banks before you promise anyone a quick crossing.",
      "text_sha256": "59db080453a3d0dacf51a9c279f0be81beca317f80551c17c70ea7b18e8809ec",
      "cast_role": "rook",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "community"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "community:routine:lantern_reach:saga_nera:line",
      "speaker_id": "saga_nera",
      "canonical_speaker": "nera",
      "text": "Mark where a load can wait safely. A route is not open just because someone brave enough can get through it.",
      "text_sha256": "c00cae2a1f702c3fd28b1f08520b786a4da82f58da0053b924fe2c43ba61466d",
      "cast_role": "nera",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "community"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "community:routine:hearthward:sister_anwen:line",
      "speaker_id": "sister_anwen",
      "canonical_speaker": "anwen",
      "text": "A bed should not become another confessional. Let the person sleep first. If they want to tell us anything tomorrow, tomorrow has room for it.",
      "text_sha256": "6285a5a707519faa0376bd07c72a194f7093b42460c0c704395e07e73cc6dfa0",
      "cast_role": "sister_anwen",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "community"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "community:routine:hearthward:mira:line",
      "speaker_id": "mira",
      "canonical_speaker": "mira",
      "text": "Keep the dressings where a stranger can find them. If only I know where they are, we have built a room that stops working whenever I am tired.",
      "text_sha256": "c2f04cf10db43054f6b59ce6f20e25e15eeca960fe7b524a631a45f72733a0a0",
      "cast_role": "mira",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "community"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "community:routine:hearthward:vargan_record_keeper:line",
      "speaker_id": "vargan_record_keeper",
      "canonical_speaker": "vale",
      "text": "These are two different shelves. The public account belongs where anyone can compare it. A private statement stays sealed under its owner's terms. Do not let the shelves teach us to forget the difference.",
      "text_sha256": "c7800a9d4a7a648909f01156ec97e44b4ea3f27571999ffdef9c2f43bb921657",
      "cast_role": "vale",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "community"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "community:routine:hearthward:vargan_steward:line",
      "speaker_id": "vargan_steward",
      "canonical_speaker": "merrow",
      "text": "I used to call an empty column an administrative problem. Sometimes it means no one agreed to do the work. That is a fact the book must preserve.",
      "text_sha256": "2460416539d2fd770be1882ba4cee4d2908f17a3714f0e96202ed25286d77783",
      "cast_role": "merrow",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "community"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "community:routine:hearthward:saga_nessa:line",
      "speaker_id": "saga_nessa",
      "canonical_speaker": "nessa",
      "text": "If the rota has a gap, put the gap on the board. Hiding it only means the same tired person fills it again.",
      "text_sha256": "baf6c5d257054591e65055b130921758e455813b1eb810fbef636adbee0034aa",
      "cast_role": "nessa",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "community"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "community:routine:hearthward:saga_nera:line",
      "speaker_id": "saga_nera",
      "canonical_speaker": "nera",
      "text": "A handover needs an answer from the next pair of hands. Leaving a bundle beside someone is not the same thing.",
      "text_sha256": "70d9b024dac3e251d8bea5b273bf1f145f2fe2644671afad2e2be7fbf132a3b9",
      "cast_role": "nera",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "community"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "community:routine:hearthward:rook:line",
      "speaker_id": "rook",
      "canonical_speaker": "rook",
      "text": "I have spent half my life learning which doors want payment before they open. Leave this one easy to find from the road.",
      "text_sha256": "d19efad61e0914cc1e025c335267cdc60a0dce12452f2d3253a653475d032f4d",
      "cast_role": "rook",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "community"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "community:routine:hearthward:blacksmith_tor:line",
      "speaker_id": "blacksmith_tor",
      "canonical_speaker": "tor",
      "text": "These bunks come apart with common pegs. A room that cannot be repaired by the people using it is only waiting to close.",
      "text_sha256": "f99ad22707e3604ae147a56f2cbc1bf6421109bff2f8af3d4748b23643bc375d",
      "cast_role": "tor",
      "direction": "everyday",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "community"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "community:participant:anwen:hearthward",
      "speaker_id": "sister_anwen",
      "canonical_speaker": "anwen",
      "text": "A bed should not become another confessional. Let the person sleep first. If they want to tell us anything tomorrow, tomorrow has room for it.",
      "text_sha256": "6285a5a707519faa0376bd07c72a194f7093b42460c0c704395e07e73cc6dfa0",
      "cast_role": "sister_anwen",
      "direction": "",
      "required_new_or_recipe_changed": true,
      "directory": "community"
    },
